      "index": "b2J",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "ProviderMissing → controller.Errors\npayment.provider.configured=false 时返回 503\n启用后为本地 sandbox，不代表真实支付通道已接入\nSANDBOX_CALLBACK_SECRET 为空时拒绝回调",
      "originalText": "ProviderMissing → controller.Errors\npayment.provider.configured=false 时返回 503\n启用后为本地 sandbox，不代表真实支付通道已接入\nSANDBOX_CALLBACK_SECRET 为空时拒绝回调",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "arch-0143",
      "autoResize": true,
